summary: Key management test for the tang operator
description: |
    Verify that the tang operator key management works correctly by testing
    API-driven key rotation, tracking active and hidden key counts, selective
    and bulk deletion of hidden keys, and checking running and ready replica
    status with multiple replicas.
contact: Patrik Koncity <pkoncity@redhat.com>
component:
  - tang
test: ./runtest.sh
recommend:
  - tang
duration: 30m
enabled: true
tag:
  - NoRHEL6
  - NoRHEL7
  - NoRHEL8
  - Tier3
tier: '3'
adjust:
  - enabled: false
    when: distro < rhel-9
    continue: false
  - enabled: false
    when: distro == rhel-alt-7
    continue: false
id: c57a5844-a25c-4a8a-98af-1675c4e64e82
